## This is a work in progress. Use at your own risk.

This portal is a personal project, built for and tested on exactly one
machine — the author's Framework Desktop (Ubuntu on AMD Strix Halo). It
has not been tested on any other device, operating system, GPU, or
driver stack. It manages services, units, model files, and system
configuration on the machine it runs on.

THE PROJECT IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR
PURPOSE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR
ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, ARISING FROM, OUT OF, OR IN
CONNECTION WITH THE PROJECT OR USE OF THE PROJECT.

Keep a backup before letting it act (`./deploy/install.sh --backup`),
and read what a destructive action asks you to confirm.

Model weights, datasets, and downloaded components (llama.cpp, ComfyUI,
Hugging Face tooling, and every model file) carry their own licenses,
which this license does not modify.
